      "writtenOn": "2025-03-03T23:34:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, but you still have two identifiers for the VM in that case: the handle and the loaded vCPU. That\u0027s why I would prefer to pass the vCPU pointer, so there\u0027s no room for discrepancy.",
      "parentUuid": "9e34bde4_25ba8197",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 79,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 79,
