      "writtenOn": "2025-03-04T01:06:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not comfortable with that suggestion because we can end up giving the host buffers if we accidentally pass a NULL ptr there. It also relies on the fact that only the VMs have hyp_vcpus which is internal pKVM knowledge about how this works.",
      "parentUuid": "76182a3d_2a818cd8",
